projectdescription:
Certified Professional Program - New Building - To construct a new 5-storey commercial building consisting of: 

Storage Garage having vehicular access from the lane at level 1; Brewery (Group F, Division 2) at level 2; Office/Production Studio (Group D, Group F Division 2) at levels 3 and 4; and Office (Group D) at level 5.

Stage I (excavation/ shoring) issued April 22, 22

Stage II (foundation to grade) issued November 7/22

Stage III (full permit) issued August 31/23

Revision 1 (Issued April 3, 2025):
Change of CP from Michael Ferber to Marc Showers, P.Eng., CP effective March 6, 2025

Revision#2 (May 5, 2026) changes to the following:
-roof change from CLT to noncombustible OWSJ; 
- vertical service space removed;
- fire shutters for rear windows (exit exposure) due to high ceiling; 
- Unit 201 & 202 merged as one; public corridor for Unit 301 extends to connect directly to exit stair 3; 
- Units 401 & 402 merged as one (to match TI permits); 
- central storage changed to a washroom near Unit 201
- protection method for steel columns (change to gypsum board in some areas)

Low Density Housing - Addition / Alteration - Interior/Exterior alterations to this existing one family dwelling

scope of work:

1.    Convert carport to garage;
2.    alterations to 1st and 2nd floor;
3     add cover to rear upper deck etc.
